{"id":"793d10b1dc983f6a55314909664e35107047dcfef3b045c0098a6e32f051b9fe","at":"2026-10-27T04:51:16Z","commit":"b9541d724f9b8e6bd225feeaf03ab95d61bbb76a","parents":["b9a8324c787b1bd59a9a7cec30937e472ac8eb7588706dfb4e7db47c55005596"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Plug.ClientIpTest: trusted peer: the right-most untrusted entry is the client","hash":"c89c8193"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/01-client-ip.md#plug-client-ip-rule","hash":"26ebd290"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"§2's second bullet, walking from the right: behind trusted 10.0.0.5, entries 198.51.100.7, 203.0.113.9, 10.1.2.3 give 203.0.113.9 (the trusted 10.1.2.3 is skipped, the walk stops at the first untrusted entry).","basis":"review"}
